    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66139" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλλαξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ακος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεῖραξ</span>
			, <i>youth, lad,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMag.Par.
				1.343
			</span></i>; <i>page</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				4682
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Alexandria</span>): pl. written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλακες</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῖλαξ</span>. (Prob. from
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλλω</span>, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελλείρην, μελλέφηβος</span>
			.)</div>
